cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite figrecover when publishing data recovered with this software."
type: software
title: figrecover
authors:
  - given-names: Louie
    family-names: Slocombe
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SMTG-Bham/figrecover"
abstract: >-
  figrecover recovers the points of curves from plot images, including scanned
  figures and screenshots, and writes CSV in the plot's units. It also reads
  the drawing objects in PDF and SVG figures.
keywords:
  - digitize
  - plot
  - figure
  - image
  - data extraction
